    // today — term discount AND current promo applied. Using the raw list-price
    // delta (as this did until 2026-07-25) overcharged by the whole discount
    // stack: on a 36-month term with a 30% promo running, $1,044.45 to upgrade
    // versus $665.08 to simply buy the same plan outright for the same end date.
    // Shared with the downgrade credit and with the client picker via
